      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If a UI market existed, any feature that I request here could instead be a development project that I fund myself, and once completed I could sell it on your platform with you taking a fee. Some features I'd even want to give away for free because they would help my friends and my community.\n\nThe feedback is immediate because either people buy it or they don't, no one ends up with UI changes they didn't want, and you lower your development costs while earning money from sales.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
