  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-11T09:06:09.689Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It is easy and meaningful to demonstrate the value of a product when people choose it freely, uncoerced, in the presence of competing alternatives.\n\nThis demonstration is not possible or credible when alternatives are eliminated.\n\nBy creating an on platform UI marketplace for a variety of features, developers with VRC and within the community will get clear feedback. No speculation required. Everyone who can and wants to earn money by creating modifications to VRChat can earn money from on platform \"mods.\"",
